    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETUP AFTER IMPORT\n\n### 1. OpenAI\nOpen **OpenAI - Qualify Lead** and select/create your **OpenAI API credential**.\n\n### 2. Google Sheets\nCreate a spreadsheet with a tab named **Leads** and put these headers in row 1:\n\nTimestamp | Name | Email | Company | Service | Budget | Timeline | Project Description | AI Score | Lead Status | AI Summary | Recommended Action | Route Action | Email Subject | Email Reply\n\nThen open **Append Lead to Google Sheets**, connect Google Sheets, and select your spreadsheet + Leads tab.\n\n### 3. Gmail\nOpen **Send Personalized Reply** and connect your Gmail OAuth2 credential.\n\n### 4. Test\nOpen **Lead Form** → Test Form URL → submit a test lead → inspect every node.\n\n### Important\nKeep the workflow inactive until all credentials and the Google Sheet are configured.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 560
      },
